[{"client_msg_id":"fc17bac8-58ad-4f7a-8948-3d99c9aad831","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"設定パクったり、仮で動かしてみたりに使ってくだされば、それで十分です\n一応自分のefmの設定を変数にセットする機能はありますが...たぶんvim-lsp-settingsでefm-langserverを有効にしてefm-langserverが読むところに自分の設定を置けばいいですからね","ts":"1629722416.034000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f8E0V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb31c21f-9836-4968-a5c4-44e9630ab20f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"書くにしても end_col をどうやって設定するかって問題がまだ解決してないんだよな","ts":"1629722389.033400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bt7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bb4cf16-5047-478c-9986-2115ad8f885a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど…自前で設定書くしかないかー","ts":"1629722353.032200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n=oq9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c0af917-e5e1-4ccc-b450-6a95fac1d99e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"手軽にlint系コマンドをefmで動かせる設定セット以上ではないですからね...","ts":"1629722336.031800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HF1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed6d92da-efc1-4cf7-b4ca-43379e07456d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なので、動くものがあれば動く、ですね\nあと設定はlintがユーザー設定やプロジェクト設定を読むならそれが適用されるのでそれで\nそこがうまくいかないやつは、「このプラグインの設定でなんとか動きますよ」ですね\nそれ以上の微調整はもうefmの設定を自前で書くしかないかなと(そしてこのプラグインがお役御免)","ts":"1629722295.031100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x=v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b53c72b-daff-4fe6-94f3-8f0d56c27b3f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"その辺りってプロジェクト固有じゃないです?","ts":"1629722217.028900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rh1qh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c276e6cd-e593-4074-b49d-ca5a77b55e62","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"lintがglobal推奨のやつだけnpmでもglobal、となっています(一応、理解している範囲で)","ts":"1629722195.028500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k8/n1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cee0f66-3608-42bc-b7fd-1eb08630af48","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それにはlintに合せて対応しています。\nnpx --no-installとか bundle exec実行とか","ts":"1629722171.028000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jZmD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba4d71a3-15f3-46ab-a30a-b90ac907a0f8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Docker は特殊にしても、lint 系コマンドはプロジェクトローカルだけでグローバルには入れてない、ってパターン、割とありそうな気はするんですよね","ts":"1629722136.027500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lCuy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"016d8d3f-3e32-4466-859b-3083132fd42f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほどなぁ","ts":"1629722066.026600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XXhx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"386a209b-2525-4b47-bfa8-fff1e3c79424","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"入れて動く vim-lsp-settings 風味を目指していることと、設定ファイルで動く efm-langserver なので\n動的に生成する処理作るとかすれば、絶対不可能じゃないけど...ですね","ts":"1629722045.026400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n9LQl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d8170d7-218b-4fa5-9e00-021fb3a00654","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど、コマンド自体を wrap しないと無理か…キビシイ","ts":"1629721958.025400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jtsk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec3d17e3-f2b2-4614-adaa-f91142d24d2f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"うえーっと、その手のカスタマイズ性はあえて持せない all-in-one 思想なので、たぶん無理じゃないかなあ...\nコマンド同名の処理スクリプトを作るとかしてwrapするならいけるかもだけど...","ts":"1629721872.025000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+cK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd88c964-775a-49cb-a3be-71ca24f994b1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":memo: 今度試す \u003chttps://github.com/tsuyoshicho/vim-efm-langserver-settings\u003e\n懸念: 環境が特殊で、lint コマンドを docker-compose 経由で叩く必要がある。カスタマイズは可能かどうか","ts":"1629721776.024000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"tsuyoshicho/vim-efm-langserver-settings","id":1,"title":"tsuyoshicho/vim-efm-langserver-settings","text":"vim lsp client - efm-langserver link and configure settings","fields":[{"title":"Website","value":"\u003chttps://tsuyoshicho.github.io/vim-efm-langserver-settings/\u003e","short":true},{"title":"Stars","value":"41","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P0dW"}]}]
